# The example extension that shows Obsidian Kanban boards (examples/extensions/kanban-board),
# installed in the empty home by tests/drive.rs. Inbox/Field Season.md has kanban-plugin in its
# frontmatter, so the extension's [[shows]] claims it: in the tree the reader previews it and
# says so, Enter hands it to the extension, which shows its lanes and cards. x ticks a card
# through items/edit, Markdown writes it, and the board follows. v opens the plain reader on the
# note, Ctrl-o comes back to the board, and the quick switcher brings the board to the front.
# Enter on a card opens the note at the card's line, in the reader. tests/drive.rs reads the
# note after.
size 140x24
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for example-workspace
keys /
type field season
wait-for Field Season
keys enter j
wait-for ⏎ open in kanban-board · → read
expect ☐ Pack the gas masks
keys enter
wait-for ▾ To do  2
expect ☑ Renew the park permit
expect Backlinks none
keys j j
wait-for ☐ Pack the gas masks
keys x
wait-for ☑ Pack the gas masks
screen
keys v
wait-for Inbox/Field Season › To do  reading
expect ☑ Pack the gas masks
keys ctrl+o
wait-for ▾ To do  2
keys esc
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys p
type field
wait-for Field Season
keys enter
wait-for ▾ Doing  1
keys j j j j
keys enter
wait-for Field Season › Doing  reading
expect ☐ Read up on pāhoehoe
keys ctrl+o
wait-for ▾ Doing  1
keys esc
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys q
exits 0
